@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

# User groups
hpc:Lsfadmin a owl:Class .
hpc:lsfadmins rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "lsfadmins" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Usergroup .

# Configuration templates
hpc:Configurationtemplate a owl:Class .
hpc:CONFIGURATION_TEMPLATE rdf:type hpc:ConfigurationTemplate ;
    rdfs:label "CONFIGURATION_TEMPLATE" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Property .

# EGO daemon control
hpc:egoDaemonControl a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Lsfconfiguration ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

# Enable cgroup
hpc:enableCgroup a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Lsfconfiguration ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

# Enable dynamic hosts
hpc:enableDynamicHosts a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Lsfconfiguration ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

# Enable EGO
hpc:enableEgo a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Lsfconfiguration ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

# Define classes
hpc:Lsfconfiguration a owl:Class .
hpc:Usergroup a owl:Class .


This Turtle fragment defines classes for LSF Configuration, LSF Administrators, and User Groups. It also defines datatype properties for EGO daemon control, enable cgroup, enable dynamic hosts, and enable EGO, with their respective domains as LSFConfiguration.
